OL,3,GNEWSALandmark Beatties clock to get
OL,4,A#88k revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FA landmark clock in Wolverhampton city
OL,7,Fcentre is to get an #88,000 upgrade.
OL,9,FThe four-sided timepiece outside the
OL,10,Fformer Beatties department store was
OL,11,Finstalled on Victoria Street in 1993
OL,12,Fbut is now in need of repairs.
OL,14,FA grant from the Government's Pride in
OL,15,FPlace Impact Fund will pay for the
OL,16,Fclock to be taken down on 22 November
OL,17,Fand restored by the original
OL,18,Fmanufacturers, Smith of Derby.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
