OL,3,GNEWSALandmark Beatties clock to get
OL,4,A#88k revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Beatties family has also endorsed
OL,7,Fthe plans to revamp the clock, said
OL,8,FCity of Wolverhampton Council, which is
OL,9,Fbehind the restoration.
